---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Disclaimers | Men's Post-Divorce Coaching">
    <section class="legal-page">
        <div class="container container-narrow">
            <header class="legal-header">
                <p class="legal-breadcrumb">LEGAL DOCUMENTS</p>
                <h1>Disclaimers</h1>
                <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: February 7, 2026</p>
            </header>

            <div class="legal-content">
                <section>
                    <h2>1. Professional Advice Disclaimer</h2>
                    <p>Men's Post-Divorce Coaching (MPDC) provides educational and coaching services. We are not a law firm, a financial advisory firm, or a medical practice. The information provided through our website, programs, and coaching sessions is not intended to be, and should not be taken as, legal, financial, or medical advice.</p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2>2. No Attorney-Client Relationship</h2>
                    <p>Using our services, reading our content, or communicating with our team does not create an attorney-client relationship. If you require legal advice, you should consult with a licensed attorney in your specific jurisdiction.</p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2>3. Earnings and Results Disclaimer</h2>
                    <p>While we provide frameworks and strategies designed to help men rebuild their lives, we cannot and do not guarantee any specific outcomes, including but not limited to financial gain, legal results, or emotional states. Any testimonials or examples shown are for illustrative purposes and do not represent a guarantee that you will achieve the same results.</p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2>4. Personal Responsibility</h2>
                    <p>By using our services, you acknowledge that you are solely responsible for your own decisions, actions, and results. You agree that Men's Post-Divorce Coaching and Athens NLP Studies, LLC are not liable for any decisions you make based on our content or coaching.</p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2>5. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
                    <p>Some of the links on this website may be affiliate links, meaning we may earn a small commission if you click them and make a purchase. This does not increase the cost to you and helps us continue to provide valuable content.</p>
                </section>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal-page {
        padding: 8rem 0;
        background-color: #fff;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .container-narrow {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 2rem;
    }

    .legal-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 5rem;
    }

    .legal-breadcrumb {
        color: var(--color-accent);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 3.5rem;
        color: var(--color-bg-primary);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .last-updated {
        color: #888;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .legal-content h2 {
        color: var(--color-bg-primary);
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 3rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        text-transform: none;
        letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .legal-content p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #444;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
</style>
